    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2287cb05-2595-4484-9628-e606af0ae008-image.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 198px;\" /></p><p>Impulse,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Change in momentum</p><p>Therefore,<br />Impulse,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>",
